<!--
    Morro's notification small icon: the ghost, in one colour.

    Notification icons are drawn as a mask and tinted by the system, so this is a single white
    silhouette with the eyes punched out (fillType="evenOdd") rather than a two-tone drawing. It has
    to stay legible at 18dp in the status bar, which is why it is a bold outline and not detail.

    Replaces the framework's `android.R.drawable.ic_dialog_alert` / `ic_popup_reminder`, which made
    the alarm notification look like a system warning from another app.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="24dp"
    android:height="24dp"
    android:viewportWidth="24"
    android:viewportHeight="24">

